\" content=\"creator tools, image compressor, qr generator, youtube tag extractor, text case converter, fancy text generator, link in bio\"/><meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow\"/><link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://creatorunits.com/tools/utility/url-encoder-decoder\"/><meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"URL Encoder Decoder - Percent Encoding Online Tool | Creators Units\"/><meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Encode or decode strings to URL safe formats online. Translate special characters and spaces instantly. Runs client-side.\"/><meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://creatorunits.com/og-image.png\"/><meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1200\"/><meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"630\"/><meta property=\"og:image:alt\" content=\"URL Encoder / Decoder - Creators Units\"/><meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\"/><meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\"/><meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"URL Encoder Decoder - Percent Encoding Online Tool | Creators Units\"/><meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"Encode or decode strings to URL safe formats online. Translate special characters and spaces instantly. Runs client-side.\"/><meta name=\"twitter:image\" content=\"https://creatorunits.com/og-image.png\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\"/><link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\"/><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Creators Units\",\"url\":\"https://creatorunits.com\",\"logo\":\"https://creatorunits.com/logo.png\",\"description\":\"Free, fast, and privacy-focused online tools for creators, freelancers, and small businesses.\",\"sameAs\":[],\"contactPoint\":{\"@type\":\"ContactPoint\",\"contactType\":\"customer service\",\"email\":\"support@creatorunits.com\",\"availableLanguage\":\"English\"}}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"WebSite\",\"name\":\"Creators Units\",\"url\":\"https://creatorunits.com\",\"description\":\"Free online tools for creators, freelancers, and small businesses.\",\"potentialAction\":{\"@type\":\"SearchAction\",\"target\":{\"@type\":\"EntryPoint\",\"urlTemplate\":\"https://creatorunits.com/tools?q={search_term_string}\"},\"query-input\":\"required name=search_term_string\"}}</script><script>\n              (function() {\n                try {\n                  const savedTheme = localStorage.getItem('theme');\n                  const systemPrefersDark = window.matchMedia('(prefers-color-scheme: dark)').matches;\n                  const theme = savedTheme || (systemPrefersDark ? 'dark' : 'light');\n                  document.documentElement.setAttribute('data-theme', theme);\n                } catch (e) {}\n              })();\n            </script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/polyfills-42372ed130431b0a.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body><div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><div style=\"visibility:hidden\" class=\"page-wrapper\"><a href=\"#main-content\" class=\"skip-to-content\">Skip to content</a><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"WebApplication\",\"name\":\"URL Encoder / Decoder\",\"url\":\"https://creatorunits.com/tools/utility/url-encoder-decoder\",\"applicationCategory\":\"UtilityApplication\",\"operatingSystem\":\"All\",\"browserRequirements\":\"Requires HTML5, Javascript, Canvas\",\"description\":\"Encode or decode strings to ensure safe transmission within query parameters.\"}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What is URL encoding?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"URL encoding, also known as percent-encoding, is a mechanism that translates special characters inside a web address into a safe format. Because URLs can only contain specific alphanumeric characters and a few select symbols, other characters are replaced with a percent sign (%) followed by their hexadecimal code to prevent browser errors.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Why is URL encoding necessary?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"URL encoding is necessary because characters like spaces, question marks, ampersands, and slashes have special meanings in URL structures. If you include these characters raw in query parameters, browsers will misinterpret them, causing broken links, database errors, or security vulnerabilities during data transmission.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"When should I decode a URL?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"You should decode a URL when you retrieve raw tracking links or query parameters that contain encoded percent symbols (like %20 for spaces or %26 for ampersands). Decoding translates these hexadecimal strings back into human-readable text, making it easy to read tracking data or analyze website analytics parameters.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Can encoded URLs improve compatibility?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes, encoding URLs guarantees compatibility across all browsers, web servers, database systems, and API endpoints. It ensures that complex strings containing non-English characters or mathematical symbols are transmitted securely without getting corrupted or rejected by network routers and content management platforms.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Is URL encoding safe?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes, URL encoding is completely safe. It is a standard web protocol that does not modify the underlying data; it simply formats it for secure transmission. Additionally, our tool processes all encoding and decoding locally in your browser, keeping your text inputs and URLs completely private.\"}}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Home\",\"item\":\"https://creatorunits.com/\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Utility Tools\",\"item\":\"https://creatorunits.com/category/utility\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"URL Encoder / Decoder\",\"item\":\"https://creatorunits.com/tools/utility/url-encoder-decoder\"}]}</script><header class=\"Header_header__hO3lJ\" role=\"banner\"><div class=\"Header_nav__3fHSH container\"><a class=\"Header_logo__e5KhT\" aria-label=\"Creators Units - Go to homepage\" href=\"/\"><svg class=\"Header_logoIcon__VF71g\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"3\" width=\"8\" height=\"18\" rx=\"2\"></rect><rect x=\"13\" y=\"3\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" rx=\"2\"></rect><rect x=\"13\" y=\"13\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" rx=\"2\"></rect></svg><span class=\"Header_logoText__4ZhAR\">Creators Units</span></a><nav class=\"Header_menu__phTUR\" aria-label=\"Main navigation\"><a class=\"Header_link__7__6t Header_linkActive__t3uQf\" aria-current=\"page\" href=\"/tools\">Explore Tools</a><a class=\"Header_link__7__6t \" href=\"/category/image\">Image Tools</a><a class=\"Header_link__7__6t \" href=\"/category/creator\">Creator Tools</a><a class=\"Header_link__7__6t \" href=\"/category/social\">Social Tools</a><a class=\"Header_link__7__6t \" href=\"/category/utility\">Utility Tools</a><a class=\"Header_link__7__6t \" href=\"/about\">About</a><a class=\"Header_link__7__6t \" href=\"/contact\">Contact</a></nav><div class=\"Header_actions__SRauh\"><button class=\"Header_themeToggle__nT4h5\" aria-label=\"Switch to dark mode\" title=\"Toggle to dark theme\"><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M21 12.79A9 9 0 1 1 11.21 3 7 7 0 0 0 21 12.79z\"></path></svg></button><button class=\"Header_menuToggle__cfdoi\" aria-label=\"Open navigation menu\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"mobile-nav\"><svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><line x1=\"3\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"21\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"3\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"21\" y2=\"6\"></line><line x1=\"3\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"21\" y2=\"18\"></line></svg></button></div></div></header><main class=\"main-content section\" id=\"main-content\"><div class=\"container\"><nav aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\" style=\"margin-bottom:1rem;font-size:0.85rem\"><ol style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0;align-items:center\"><li><a style=\"color:var(--text-muted);text-decoration:none\" href=\"/\">Home</a></li><li aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin:0 0.5rem;color:var(--text-muted)\">/</li><li><a style=\"color:var(--text-muted);text-decoration:none\" href=\"/category/utility\">Utility Tools</a></li><li aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin:0 0.5rem;color:var(--text-muted)\">/</li><li aria-current=\"page\" style=\"color:var(--text-primary);font-weight:600\">URL Encoder / Decoder</li></ol></nav><div style=\"margin-bottom:2rem\"><h1 style=\"font-size:2.25rem;margin-bottom:0.5rem\">URL Encoder / Decoder</h1><p class=\"text-muted\" style=\"font-size:1.05rem;margin:0\">Encode or decode strings to ensure safe transmission within query parameters.</p></div><section style=\"margin-bottom:3rem\" aria-label=\"URL Encoder / Decoder tool interface\"><!--$!--><template data-dgst=\"BAILOUT_TO_CLIENT_SIDE_RENDERING\"></template><!--/$--></section><div class=\"grid-cols-2\" style=\"gap:2rem;margin-bottom:3rem\"><div class=\"card\"><h2 style=\"font-size:1.25rem;margin-bottom:1rem\">📋 How to Use</h2><ol style=\"padding-left:1.25rem;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:0.5rem;font-size:0.9rem\"><li style=\"color:var(--text-secondary)\">Paste your text or encoded link parameter in the input panel.</li><li style=\"color:var(--text-secondary)\">Click &#x27;Encode&#x27; to escape special characters, or &#x27;Decode&#x27; to convert back to standard text.</li><li style=\"color:var(--text-secondary)\">Copy the converted output with one click.</li></ol></div><div class=\"card\"><h2 style=\"font-size:1.25rem;margin-bottom:1rem\">⚡ Key Features</h2><ul style=\"padding-left:1.25rem;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:0.5rem;font-size:0.9rem;list-style-type:square\"><li style=\"color:var(--text-secondary)\">Instant translation of % characters.</li><li style=\"color:var(--text-secondary)\">Clean double-panel layout.</li><li style=\"color:var(--text-secondary)\">Handles long query strings.</li></ul></div></div><section class=\"card\" style=\"background-color:var(--bg-primary);padding:2.5rem;margin-bottom:3.5rem\"><h2 style=\"font-size:1.75rem;margin-bottom:1rem\">Encode and Decode URL Query Strings Instantly</h2><p class=\"text-muted\" style=\"font-size:1.05rem;margin-bottom:1.5rem\">Format web addresses properly. Safe-escape characters in database queries or UTM inputs using our simple encoder.</p><div style=\"font-size:0.95rem;color:var(--text-secondary);line-height:1.75;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:1.25rem\">\n<h3>Ensuring Safe Query Transmission</h3>\n<p>If you pass raw spaces or ampersands in a URL path without encoding, browsers will parse them as parameter separators, breaking search queries. Convert them here before inserting parameters.</p>\n    </div></section><section style=\"margin-bottom:3.5rem\" aria-labelledby=\"tool-faq-heading\"><h2 id=\"tool-faq-heading\" class=\"text-center mb-6\">Frequently Asked Questions</h2><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-4\" style=\"max-width:800px;margin:0 auto\"><details class=\"card\"><summary style=\"font-size:1.05rem;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;padding:0.5rem 0;list-style:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">What is URL encoding?<span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"font-size:1.25rem;color:var(--success)\">+</span></summary><p class=\"text-muted\" style=\"font-size:0.9rem;margin:0.5rem 0 0 0;padding-top:0.5rem;border-top:1px solid var(--border-color)\">URL encoding, also known as percent-encoding, is a mechanism that translates special characters inside a web address into a safe format. Because URLs can only contain specific alphanumeric characters and a few select symbols, other characters are replaced with a percent sign (%) followed by their hexadecimal code to prevent browser errors.</p></details><details class=\"card\"><summary style=\"font-size:1.05rem;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;padding:0.5rem 0;list-style:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">Why is URL encoding necessary?<span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"font-size:1.25rem;color:var(--success)\">+</span></summary><p class=\"text-muted\" style=\"font-size:0.9rem;margin:0.5rem 0 0 0;padding-top:0.5rem;border-top:1px solid var(--border-color)\">URL encoding is necessary because characters like spaces, question marks, ampersands, and slashes have special meanings in URL structures. If you include these characters raw in query parameters, browsers will misinterpret them, causing broken links, database errors, or security vulnerabilities during data transmission.</p></details><details class=\"card\"><summary style=\"font-size:1.05rem;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;padding:0.5rem 0;list-style:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">When should I decode a URL?<span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"font-size:1.25rem;color:var(--success)\">+</span></summary><p class=\"text-muted\" style=\"font-size:0.9rem;margin:0.5rem 0 0 0;padding-top:0.5rem;border-top:1px solid var(--border-color)\">You should decode a URL when you retrieve raw tracking links or query parameters that contain encoded percent symbols (like %20 for spaces or %26 for ampersands). Decoding translates these hexadecimal strings back into human-readable text, making it easy to read tracking data or analyze website analytics parameters.</p></details><details class=\"card\"><summary style=\"font-size:1.05rem;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;padding:0.5rem 0;list-style:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">Can encoded URLs improve compatibility?<span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"font-size:1.25rem;color:var(--success)\">+</span></summary><p class=\"text-muted\" style=\"font-size:0.9rem;margin:0.5rem 0 0 0;padding-top:0.5rem;border-top:1px solid var(--border-color)\">Yes, encoding URLs guarantees compatibility across all browsers, web servers, database systems, and API endpoints. It ensures that complex strings containing non-English characters or mathematical symbols are transmitted securely without getting corrupted or rejected by network routers and content management platforms.</p></details><details class=\"card\"><summary style=\"font-size:1.05rem;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;padding:0.5rem 0;list-style:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">Is URL encoding safe?<span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"font-size:1.25rem;color:var(--success)\">+</span></summary><p class=\"text-muted\" style=\"font-size:0.9rem;margin:0.5rem 0 0 0;padding-top:0.5rem;border-top:1px solid var(--border-color)\">Yes, URL encoding is completely safe. It is a standard web protocol that does not modify the underlying data; it simply formats it for secure transmission. Additionally, our tool processes all encoding and decoding locally in your browser, keeping your text inputs and URLs completely private.</p></details></div></section><section style=\"border-top:1px solid var(--border-color);padding-top:3rem\" aria-labelledby=\"related-heading\"><h2 id=\"related-heading\" class=\"mb-6\">Related <!-- -->Utility Tools</h2><div class=\"grid-cols-4\"><a class=\"card card-hover flex flex-col gap-2\" style=\"text-decoration:none;color:inherit;padding:1.25rem\" aria-label=\"Open QR Code Generator - Generate standard QR codes for URLs, text, or Wi-Fi configurations.\" href=\"/tools/utility/qr-code-generator\"><h3 style=\"font-size:1rem;margin:0\">QR Code Generator</h3><p class=\"text-muted\" style=\"font-size:0.8rem;margin:0;flex-grow:1;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;display:-webkit-box;-webkit-line-clamp:2;-webkit-box-orient:vertical\">Generate standard QR codes for URLs, text, or Wi-Fi configurations.</p></a><a class=\"card card-hover flex flex-col gap-2\" style=\"text-decoration:none;color:inherit;padding:1.25rem\" aria-label=\"Open UTM Campaign Builder - Build marketing campaign links with source, medium, and term tracking codes.\" href=\"/tools/utility/utm-builder\"><h3 style=\"font-size:1rem;margin:0\">UTM Campaign Builder</h3><p class=\"text-muted\" style=\"font-size:0.8rem;margin:0;flex-grow:1;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;display:-webkit-box;-webkit-line-clamp:2;-webkit-box-orient:vertical\">Build marketing campaign links with source, medium, and term tracking codes.</p></a><a class=\"card card-hover flex flex-col gap-2\" style=\"text-decoration:none;color:inherit;padding:1.25rem\" aria-label=\"Open Secure Password Generator - Create cryptographically secure, random passwords with custom rules.\" href=\"/tools/utility/password-generator\"><h3 style=\"font-size:1rem;margin:0\">Secure Password Generator</h3><p class=\"text-muted\" style=\"font-size:0.8rem;margin:0;flex-grow:1;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;display:-webkit-box;-webkit-line-clamp:2;-webkit-box-orient:vertical\">Create cryptographically secure, random passwords with custom rules.</p></a><a class=\"card card-hover flex flex-col gap-2\" style=\"text-decoration:none;color:inherit;padding:1.25rem\" aria-label=\"Open Text Case Converter - Convert text formats: UPPERCASE, lowercase, Title Case, Sentence Case, or slugify.\" href=\"/tools/utility/text-case-converter\"><h3 style=\"font-size:1rem;margin:0\">Text Case Converter</h3><p class=\"text-muted\" style=\"font-size:0.8rem;margin:0;flex-gro